{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "ea6454d3b0fdd88bb3ca945668d4e45cbd3ed4c99892c0a496aca587143baba7", "ja": "清涼飲料水のCM撮影", "zh": "拍摄清凉饮料广告娱乐代理", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5000_place", "source_sha256": "61a487c630456e021dfe73cc2348c99a87bb7f0a236b52a2e70c05db00d3b084", "ja": "グラウンド", "zh": "操场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5001_p", "source_sha256": "a9ac7cfc5779b09769a9a18d9e852bbaa42ed04736cb4d812e7cdc1e6c0a2b86", "ja": "（今日は春香のCM撮影の日。新商品のドリンクの\nコンセプトは『部活で頑張るキミを応援！』だ！）", "zh": "（今天是春香拍摄广告的日子。新商品饮料的主题是『为在社团活动中努力的你加油！』！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5002_001har", "source_sha256": "e607ea21b7fa2f4b5597e37a53623dbe2cbd9c0d51b3a280761d74235d6ba1d0", "ja": "部活で汗を流すって、ザ・青春～って感じですよね♪\nそんな人たちの力になれるなんて、嬉しいです！", "zh": "在社团活动中挥洒汗水，就是满满的青春感觉呢♪\n能为这样的人们助一臂之力，我很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5003_001har", "source_sha256": "3c24209630caaed78d1a14386bfb9856189685634e5156ca94ae0da521c939fe", "ja": "いつもファンの人達の応援には力をもらってますし、\n今日は私がめいっぱい応援しちゃいます！", "zh": "我一直都从粉丝们的支持中获得力量，今天就让我尽情为大家加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5004_p", "source_sha256": "96119b1873c741cee8976816a413a8ae68cd8b6ca04af781815c495585380bf8", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ！　やっぱり、応援があると\nないとでは、やる気もまるで変わってくるもんな。", "zh": "啊，就是这股干劲！果然，有没有加油打气，干劲完全不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5005_001har", "source_sha256": "c6643412682bf8c460e35f217680aae376f58fcae921eaae769a6d05a9f72abc", "ja": "それでですね、{$P$}さんに\n相談があるんですけど……。", "zh": "然后呢，我有件事想和{$P$}先生商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5006_001har", "source_sha256": "75fe6dd2a7c5735789feb49658395dc1470c683ef6c002b276a3c21eb6053c34", "ja": "もし、{$P$}さんが応援されると\nして、どんな風に応援をされたら元気が出ますか？", "zh": "如果是为{$P$}先生加油的话，您希望以什么样的方式为您加油，才会让您打起精神呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5007_001har", "source_sha256": "a3c6af67c4993be8b18796fe4bfdaf5783c64aa69e51fdd1254ab62e19961483", "ja": "それを参考に、イメージをふくらませたいなあって\n思って。教えてもらえたら嬉しいです！", "zh": "我想以此为参考，进一步丰富一下想象。要是能告诉我，我会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5008_p", "source_sha256": "b2b34100bf15e9ca14086a3f475c97ee5c019a24870595e2abca8873536e1045", "ja": "どんな風に応援、か……。そうだなぁ……。", "zh": "怎样去加油啊……这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5009", "source_sha256": "d88cb7c621e72927a20dc78fa5a0e3d947e71bad1946a3f0e14d3d23070ef8df", "ja": "とにかく熱く！", "zh": "总之热血起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5010", "source_sha256": "c624496a98638b061ca88d92264c242580cea77660ab19a2e2de6953efb12e58", "ja": "ひたすら優しく！", "zh": "要一直温柔哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5200_p", "source_sha256": "1ea552765ee89ed234988e36737bb29ea2193082a902ebfec7d5819408d1ffdc", "ja": "俺は、とにかく熱く背中を押してもらいたいな！\nそうしたら、限界以上の力を出せると思うんだ。", "zh": "我希望你能全力为我加油打气！\n感觉那样的话，我就能发挥出超越极限的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5201_001har", "source_sha256": "2e687a1074e62977a3387d6996e2d2b56384ae224cd288d9431fd67d40946ac2", "ja": "なるほど、熱い応援ですね！　よーし！\nフレー、フレー、{$P$}！", "zh": "原来如此，是热情的加油啊！好——！\n加油，加油，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5202_001har", "source_sha256": "b2830bc2e1e1b2da4b8e60c09bcf94c7169a019b34c9380fc2463faa986a320c", "ja": "ファイトだゴーゴー、{$P$}っ！\n……どうかな。元気、出ましたか？　えへへっ♪", "zh": "加油冲冲冲，{$P$}！\n……怎么样？打起精神来了吗？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5300_p", "source_sha256": "1ea552765ee89ed234988e36737bb29ea2193082a902ebfec7d5819408d1ffdc", "ja": "俺は、とにかく熱く背中を押してもらいたいな！\nそうしたら、限界以上の力を出せると思うんだ。", "zh": "我希望你能全力为我加油打气！\n感觉那样的话，我就能发挥出超越极限的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5301_001har", "source_sha256": "3579a3c6f8d0b00439bee6f138e575f05c4221fb709de22d6db33c30324a4011", "ja": "熱い応援ですね！　任せてください！\nうおおおおっ！　やる気だ、やる気だー！！　やる……", "zh": "热情的加油是吧！交给我吧！\n呜哦哦哦哦！拿出干劲，拿出干劲——！！要干……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5302_001har", "source_sha256": "f5f92008fa177e48d4447d4d47856550e110502c6a4425b1080d3abe483b0030", "ja": "げほっ、ごほっ……あ、熱い応援って結構大変ですね。\nまず私が水分補給しないといけなくなりそうです……！", "zh": "咳咳、咳咳……热情应援还真是挺辛苦的呢。\n看来得先给自己补充水分才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5500_p", "source_sha256": "81fe4b6de79929f8b8bb8028584b588e3d4bc614ff6db9db6a455a8ccdb5cf0c", "ja": "応援してほしい時って、疲れてる時も多いと思うんだ。\nだから、俺はひたすら優しくしてもらいたいな。", "zh": "想要别人为自己打气的时候，往往也是很疲惫的时候吧。\n所以，我希望对方能一个劲地温柔对待我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5501_001har", "source_sha256": "03da329065f69bcbfd482a3787baa923ed0576f52e4fd825c1dee5b3021ab6a7", "ja": "確かに、優しさは大事ですよね……では、こほん。\n{$P$}さん、いつもお疲れさま。", "zh": "确实，温柔体贴很重要呢……那么，咳咳。\n{$P$}先生，你每天都辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5502_001har", "source_sha256": "a037ce07bf87d9129fc420b829702b9019c976ae69a19446a6056ca46a316c62", "ja": "たまには、私に甘えてくれてもいいんだよ？\n……な、なーんて、これはちょっと照れちゃいますね♪", "zh": "偶尔也可以向我撒撒娇哦？\n……什、什么嘛——说这种话还是有点害羞呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5600_p", "source_sha256": "81fe4b6de79929f8b8bb8028584b588e3d4bc614ff6db9db6a455a8ccdb5cf0c", "ja": "応援してほしい時って、疲れてる時も多いと思うんだ。\nだから、俺はひたすら優しくしてもらいたいな。", "zh": "想要别人为自己打气的时候，往往也是很疲惫的时候吧。\n所以，我希望对方能一个劲地温柔对待我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5601_001har", "source_sha256": "09212bebe46b48ac6d9102a055f92f51a5515ef62d10ead0bbeb270bcc0d3337", "ja": "それもいいですね！　ひたすら優しく……よし。\n{$P$}さん、喉渇いてないですか？", "zh": "这样也不错呢！一味地温柔……好。\n{$P$}先生，您口渴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_5602_001har", "source_sha256": "fc4dcc9f1acd1517b30bd969948677a1b1755c7bcbbdf1915059dbb06fdf049d", "ja": "お腹空いてませんか？　暑くないですか？　疲れ目は？\n眠くは……って、えっ、ちょっとしつこすぎですか？", "zh": "肚子饿不饿？热不热？眼睛累不累？\n困不困……哎，是不是有点太啰嗦了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
